      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. That's clear. I also need to make sure my staff understands why these specific windows are so important. Could you explain the science behind why leaving poultry in the danger zone for too long allows Clostridium perfringens to become such a problem during cooling?",
      "source": "evaluator"
